Package: intoASV
Title: Intra-Taxonomic Microdiversity Analysis from ASV Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Heekuk", "Park", , "hp2523@cumc.columbia.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a workflow for quantifying intra-taxonomic
    microdiversity from amplicon sequence variant (ASV) data stored in
    phyloseq objects. The package supports taxonomy-based or
    similarity-based grouping, within-group sequence clustering,
    nucleotide-diversity estimation, cluster diagnostics, and static or
    interactive quality-control visualizations for ASV-level distance
    structure.
